1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,551
Two dry chairs stood in the shelter.
Jason put their bag on one and

2
00:00:05,551 --> 00:00:06,740
guarded the other.

3
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:11,495
Lucia watched rain spill through the
doorway around a woman carrying a

4
00:00:11,495 --> 00:00:13,080
child against her shoulder.

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:17,840
The woman asked for nothing. She stood
beside a broken dryer, rocking

6
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:20,220
slowly while the thunder moved closer.

7
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:25,369
Jason tightened his hand around the
sack. Every wet bill inside had cost

8
00:00:25,369 --> 00:00:27,350
them something they couldn't explain.

9
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:32,903
Lucia lifted the bag off the chair.
Jason looked ready to argue, then saw

10
00:00:32,903 --> 00:00:34,490
the child's bare feet.

11
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:39,644
They stood by the door while the woman
sat. Water from their sleeves

12
00:00:39,644 --> 00:00:41,230
gathered beneath the chairs.

13
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:46,379
When daylight came, the woman thanked
them for the seats. She never asked

14
00:00:46,379 --> 00:00:48,360
what was in the bag.

15
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:53,029
Jason carried their money outside. Lucia
carried the empty chairs back

16
00:00:53,029 --> 00:00:56,000
from the leak. Both finally felt
lighter.
